# =========================================================
# Addressables
# =========================================================

# Generated Addressables content
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Temporary auto-generated StreamingAssets content
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/

# Server data / local Addressables builds
/[Ss]erver[Dd]ata/
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/[Aa]a/

