_Documentation/
[Dd]oxygen/
html/
latex/

# =========================================================
# Optional large source assets
# =========================================================

# Do not enable these blindly if these are source assets used by Unity.
# Prefer Git LFS instead for large binary assets.
#
# *.psd
# *.blend
# *.fbx
# *.wav
# *.mp3
# *.mp4
# *.mov